s is serious-saru!Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.94,0:02:22.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Bariete's ringing the bell!Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Samurai-saru! Samurai are here-saru!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:39.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the city! Tell everyone who is capable to follow me!Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:40.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:45.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Duke-sama! Your Warney is ready!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:07.72,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, that bell is very noisy. It's been ringing constantly.Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:10.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a bell to tell everyone they have a visitor?Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:14.02,Main,,0,0,0,,They must be welcoming us!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:15.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That's certainly possible!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:24.18,Main,,0,0,0,,But Law-dono was saying that...Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:29.01,Main,,0,0,0,,...the inhabitants of Zou who don't like humans are actually the Mink Tribe.Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.01,0:03:34.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, is that what people are saying? I can't understand why.Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,If that's what people are saying these days...Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:46.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Father! Kanjurou!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:49.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Kanjurou! So you're all right!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm sorry to make you worry.Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:04:01.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, why are you here alone? Where are Luffy-dono and everybody?Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:08.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, I haven't been at ease since we came to this countryDialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,so I've been sleeping in a room by myself.Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:12.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no!Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:13.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You poor thing.Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:16.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Then come with us.Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:23.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess they're assembling to welcome us!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:28.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?! Why?! Why?! Why should I be running this early in the morning?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:31.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you! Kin'emon and... What was his name?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Kanjurou!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:35.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! Those two arrived!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:39.98,Main,,0,0,0,,They say two samurai appeared and the whole country is in a great uproar!Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:44.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Master Nekomamushi headed for the city leading the Guardians!Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:48.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Another welcome banquet?! I wouldn't mind having one for two consecutive days!Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:50.72,Main,,0,0,0,,No, they've got a score to settle!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:53.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, they do!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,They were wrongly accused of hiding a samurai and almost died!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:12.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are they?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll find them right away!Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:18.06,Main,,0,0,0,,People across the country keep rolling into the city...Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:27.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro! Can you see them?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:31.90,Main,,0,0,0,,This is no good.Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't you find the samurai yet?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:41.48,Main,,0,0,0,,We're on the hunt now!Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:44.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Master, please pull back!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:45.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Pull back?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:49.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Humph! What are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:52.58,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Please. Just keep going.Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:21.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh... Oh no! The two ran into each other!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:28.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Master!Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:29.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Duke-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't do it, Master!Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:35.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Duke-sama! Please calm down!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it a fight?Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:50.22,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Man! That was...Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:00.30,Main,,0,0,0,,...Really close!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:06.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You three, take my advice and go back to the Sunny now!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:13.70,Main,,0,0,0,,How many years has it been, cat monster? You've become even more monstrous.Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:20.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What about you-gara? You've lost one of your legs.Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody, please stop them!Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:30.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Where is Raizo?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.21,0:07:32.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Give us Raizo!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:35.26,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I know Raizo is in this country!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:39.68,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We don't have such a person here! How many times do I have to tell you?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:44.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Search through the country as you please! We don't have a samurai...Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:56.16,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you'll say goodbye to this leg first, or tell us where the samurai is.Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:03.04,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let's try it, "Dog King."Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:16.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Then, there is no way for me to save this leg.Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:25.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara got your hand chopped off. You can't fight anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:28.08,Main,,0,0,0,,The most you can do is eat lasagna.Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:31.82,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Say it! Where's the samurai?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:35.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,How can I tell you something I don't know?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:38.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A person from the Land of Wano has no business here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:43.76,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,All you can do is use poison gas and attack the weakened men!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.76,0:08:46.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You cowards!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:50.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Oh no! This guy's trying to break the chains!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:54.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Is the gas really working?! Immobilize his arms!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:57.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you'd better do that!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:09:03.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you have time to harm my people, point your spear at me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:05.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,No... Master!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:10.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll take all of those crappy spears myself!Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:13.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Master!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:24.28,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that you-gara have only lost one of your legs!Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:27.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind if you were dead.Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:30.46,Main,,0,0,0,,One king is enough for the country!Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Please stop, both of you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:37.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Then let's send one of us to kingdom come!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara must die!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:43.56,Main,,0,0,0,,A dog and a cat?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:44.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:57.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard about it before, but they're really strong!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:00.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:03.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:07.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you idiot! What are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:09.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:13.26,Main,,0,0,0,,...a samurai!Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:20.06,Main,,0,0,0,,See?! They found you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:23.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Run, Kin'emon! They're gonna kill you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:25.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Momo-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, let go of me! Please!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:32.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Momo, stay away!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:35.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Kanjurou! Why did you guys come out?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:37.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! Now!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Nekomamushi! Inuarashi! Wait a minute!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,They really mean no harm!Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:52.35,Main,,0,0,0,,People from the country of Zou!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.35,0:10:57.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a retainer of the Kozuki Clan from the Land of Wano, named Kin'emon!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here to look for my comrade named Raizo who is a warrior from the same country!Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:05.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Has he been here?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:09.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, this country was destroyed because he wasn't here!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:11.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:29.14,Main,,0,0,0,,We've been expecting you.Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:34.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I don't know Raizo! I swear to god!Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:44.89,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If the man you're talking about is here, you can take my life!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:50.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo-dono is...Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,...safe!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.34,0:12:11.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's safe! I'm relieved!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:20.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait a minute!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, was Raizo here all this time?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:26.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you all know?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:40.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Y-You all almost died!Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:44.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The millennium-old city was ruined!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:55.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that we kept it a secret from you-gara guys too.Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:13:02.44,Main,,0,0,0,,The Land of Wano's Kozuki Clan and we have been like a family since way back.Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:09.92,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter what will be ruined, we'd never sell out our friends!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:32.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:32.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Am I dead?Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:39.58,Main,,0,0,0,,N-No! Definitely not!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:41.84,Main,,0,0,0,,You're alive, Jack-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:56.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm deeply grateful to you all!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,,And now, as proof, I offer you this!Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's certainly the same Kozuki Clan crest that Duke-sama, Master and Raizo-san have!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:22.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Kozuki...Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:26.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they know each other!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:32.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I was really prepared for a clash against the Minks! Jeez!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:37.77,Main,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be helped. They couldn't have told the whole story even to us.Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:42.77,Main,,0,0,0,,She just said the doggy and the kitty have the same crest.Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:47.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe, their bond is far stronger than we realize.Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.65,0:14:51.38,Main,,0,0,0,,But Inuarashi, Nekomamushi...Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:58.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It is surprising to see you two alive and well here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:14:59.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Death would've been a relief to us.Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:02.93,Main,,0,0,0,,But we thought if we trust the words from that day and wait here...Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.93,0:15:07.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, then we would get to see you-gara guys one day!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, cat monster!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I was talking to Kin'emon!Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:14.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't interrupt as you please!Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking Kin'emon must be sick of talking to you-garaDialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:24.77,Main,,0,0,0,,so I tactfully took over!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.77,0:15:27.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought they were cooled down.Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:28.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:30.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara served your purpose! Get lost!Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:32.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You get lost!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:36.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Please stop, both of you! Our long-awaited guests have just arrived!Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting! Inuarashi! Nekomamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:53.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You two used to be such good friends! Why have you been fighting like you wanna kill each other?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.99,0:15:54.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:57.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I forbid you to ever fight again!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:16:00.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's even more inexcusable if it's because of my father!Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:04.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It would make my father sad to see you two like this...Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:09.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.72,0:16:17.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Momo?Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:21.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you say it'd make your father sad?Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.29,Main,,0,0,0,,But Kin'emon's right here.Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.08,0:16:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:30.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama! I'm ashamed of myself! You're absolutely right!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:33.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:34.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Duke-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:37.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Master's bowing his head!Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:41.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Would that child be...Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:49.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama is right!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:55.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for lying to you all, too!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, Momonosuke-sama and I are...Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,...not father and son!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.90,0:17:06.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:14.07,Main,,0,0,0,,This man right here is the heir to...Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:18.54,Main,,0,0,600,,...Kozuki Oden-sama, great daimyo of Kuri in the Land of Wano!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.62,0:17:20.18,Captions,,0,0,320,,Kingdom of Wano Heir of the Daimyo of Kuri Kozuki MomonosukeDialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:21.40,Main,,0,0,3,,His name is Kozuki Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.56,0:17:29.02,Main,,0,0,0,,That means for all of us including Inuarashi and Nekomamushi,Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:31.36,Main,,0,0,0,,he's our lord!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:35.26,Main,,0,0,0,,So he's the heir of the Kozuki Family and Oden-dono's son!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:37.57,Main,,0,0,0,,How could I miss that?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:40.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Is Momo someone important?Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,If they're heading the list of his retainers, he could be quite a powerful lord.Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:51.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Along the way, if his true identity was revealed, we could've attracted more enemiesDialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:55.36,Main,,0,0,0,,so we pretended as if we were father and son.Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:18:01.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Although we trusted you all, we never had a good chance to tell you.Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:01.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I apologize.Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:08.06,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're not father and son.Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:10.40,Main,,0,0,0,,But they're alike. They're both perverts.Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I was lying! I'm actually an important figure!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:21.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, and a pervert.Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.27,0:18:22.12,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:24.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.27,0:18:28.41,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?! Bow down, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:29.78,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:34.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to change our behavior just because you're an important person?! Idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.71,0:18:36.65,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:40.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You're afraid of heights and you have no guts!Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:43.70,Main,,0,0,0,,We samurai aren't afraid of anything! How rude!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:49.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go again. He saved our lives but...Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:53.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't ask a pirate to be humble.Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.44,0:18:56.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama's getting distracted, so that's good.Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:04.65,Main,,0,0,0,,So frustrating, Onami! Luffy is a terrible guy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.65,0:19:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there, there.Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:10.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay away from her, Momonosuke-sama! You damn brat!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.00,0:19:17.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, Momo-chan,Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:21.77,Main,,0,0,0,,if your father is a lord, there must be treasure in his castle, isn't that right?Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.77,0:19:23.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:25.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You're really a bad person!Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.92,0:19:29.52,Main,,0,0,0,,It's only been a few months since...Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:36.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Their-gara cheeriness must be helping him.Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's make a truce, cat.Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,If we keep dwelling in the past, we'll make Momonosuke-sama suffer.Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, for the sake of our lord!Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:07.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll communicate with you-gara but won't connect with you-gara!Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a deal!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:18.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Look at that!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.19,0:20:20.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Those two are... No way!Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:26.24,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:28.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Our two kings made up!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:31.93,Main,,0,0,0,,The King of the Day and the King of the Night finally...Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.93,0:20:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,How amazing the Kozuki Family's power is!Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:43.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It makes me cry!Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:45.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Dr. Miyagi! You're hopping too much!Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:06.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's climb the whale.Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:11.01,Main,,0,0,0,,If you learn which vines to take, you can reach the top.Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.01,0:21:13.25,Main,,0,0,0,,So Raizo's here?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:20.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:22.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:24.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.02,0:21:25.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:26.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.37,0:21:27.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.58,0:21:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:31.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to see the ninja! Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:34.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I get to see a ninja! Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:36.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The Watery Escape Technique! Nin-nin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I still don't feel well, Kin'emon.Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:45.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You can wait at the bottom if you want, Momonosuke-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.85,0:21:53.40,Main,,0,0,0,,As we get closer to the whale, the voice I hear is getting louder.Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.12,0:22:00.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You have a similar ability to Oden-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.63,0:22:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,There was another man who used to say something like that.Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.58,0:22:09.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about the same thing.Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.16,0:22:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't believe there's an entrance here!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.78,0:22:25.38,Main,,0,0,0,,On the tail of the Whale Tree?! No one would notice!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:29.20,Main,,0,0,0,,And it's a hidden door so it's impossible to find.Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:30.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go.Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:37.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a long flight of stairs so be careful.Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.08,0:22:50.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.12,0:22:52.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Raizo's voice.Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.07,0:22:53.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! The ninja?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.81,0:22:55.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Ninja!Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.35,0:22:57.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Ninja!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.05,0:23:04.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's the ninja?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Ninja! Ninja!Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:06.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we are.Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.61,0:23:09.82,Main,,0,0,0,,He-gara is the ninja, Raizo.Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.82,0:23:11.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Ninja! Nin...Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:17.26,Main,,0,0,0,,There you are, Nekomamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.14,0:23:23.00,Main,,0,0,3,,You! Why didn't you just hand me over to them?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.49,0:23:25.81,Captions,,0,0,270,,Ninja from the Kingdom of Wano Raizo of the MistDialogue: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:26.40,Main,,0,0,3,,Everyone that brought me food here...Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:28.30,Main,,0,0,0,,...was injured!Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.78,0:23:32.67,Main,,0,0,0,,They told me the country is okay, but is it true?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.67,0:23:37.76,Main,,0,0,0,,If it's a lie, I, Raizo, will hate you!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.58,0:23:49.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.29,0:23:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He's nothing like we expected!Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.53,0:23:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think you guys are from this country! Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.22,0:24:01.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo!Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.02,0:24:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon! Kanjuro! Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.63,0:24:09.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're okay!Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:10.55,Main,,0,0,0,,We're glad you're okay too!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:11.90,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:20.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The crest of the Kozuki Family!Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.36,0:24:27.06,Main,,0,0,0,,The same as Kin'emon's!Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.78,0:24:31.86,Main,,0,0,0,,That crest has existed for centuries.Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.78,0:24:36.20,Main,,0,0,0,,And that stone is...Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.76,0:24:39.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never seen it in such a color. Deep red...Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.40,0:24:45.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a Poneglyph.Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.31,0:24:50.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We know you-gara, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.16,0:24:56.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard the Ohara people can read those letters.Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.28,0:25:02.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is that Poneglyph red?Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.42,0:25:08.40,Main,,0,0,0,,None of the Poneglyphs I've ever seen were that color.Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.30,0:25:12.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It has a different purpose.Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.10,0:25:16.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you read it?Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, may I?Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.60,0:25:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, you may.Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.10,0:25:25.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you guys? Why are you staring hard at me like that?Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.88,0:25:29.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you really a ninja?Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.10,0:25:31.38,Main,,0,0,0,,How insolent! Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.38,0:25:33.46,Main,,0,0,0,,We haven't introduced them to you yet.Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:38.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo, they're the Straw Hats. They're pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.76,0:25:39.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirates?Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.14,0:25:44.22,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're a real ninja, throw a shuriken!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:46.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Meditate under a waterfall!Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.70,0:25:49.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Say "Nin" and use ninja powers!Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.20,0:25:53.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna see the Earth Escape Technique!Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.18,0:25:54.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I want the fire version!Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.94,0:25:56.45,Main,,0,0,0,,No, the water version!Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.45,0:25:58.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Such rapid-fire requests!Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.18,0:26:01.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you pirates want to see it so badly?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.98,0:26:04.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not because we're pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.88,0:26:08.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Super!Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.63,0:26:13.76,Main,,0,0,0,,All boys like ninjas!Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.10,0:26:23.72,Main,,0,0,0,,That makes me blush.Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.88,0:26:29.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you ever gone out with a female ninja?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.40,0:26:33.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Train your jumping ability by jumping over a bamboo shoot every day!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.44,0:26:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Show me the Shadow Clone Technique.Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.86,0:26:41.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hide in the ceiling and get stabbed by a spear.Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.32,0:26:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Summon a giant frog!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.87,0:26:46.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold a scroll in your mouth and say "Nin-nin"!Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.70,0:26:48.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.10,0:26:51.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop imposing your damn dreams on me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.78,0:26:59.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We ninja don't say things like "Nin-nin"! The ninja in your heads are all fantasies!Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.59,0:27:02.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.18,0:27:07.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, what makes you a ninja?! It can't be your physique!Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.32,0:27:14.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. With this physique, I can't even attract female ninjas...Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.08,0:27:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.20,0:27:23.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen! It takes a quiet and tough mind to be a master ninja!Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.78,0:27:27.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be living in the shadows. We can't show off our techniques.Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.90,0:27:30.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Ninjutsu is not entertainment...Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.70,0:27:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Ninpo - Smoke Escape Technique!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.23,0:28:00.46,Main,,0,0,0,,He disappeared!Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.70,0:28:03.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't disappear!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.74,0:28:08.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here.Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.95,0:28:10.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.46,0:28:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,And here!Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.12,0:28:16.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Here too!Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.44,0:28:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,And here too!Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.88,0:28:21.41,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! He's got doubles?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.41,0:28:22.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Could it be...?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.30,0:28:27.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Ninpo - Shadow Clone Technique!Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.34,0:28:29.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Cool!Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.38,0:28:33.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you doubt I was really a ninja?Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.18,0:28:36.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Flower Shuriken!Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.60,0:28:38.11,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: shinobiDialogue: 0,0:28:47.45,0:28:50.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Never popular with girls but still an invincible ninja!Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.64,0:28:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo of the Mist is now...Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.12,0:29:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,...here before your eyes!Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.46,0:29:04.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo!Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.58,0:29:08.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Nin! Nin!Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.70,0:29:12.00,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing:  Datenshi, Sewil  Quality Assurance:  Mr Luffy, Galaxy 9000, Datenshi, Grug  Soundtracking:  Halee  TC/Infoboxes:  Datenshi  Translation: Crunchyroll